	 * Instruct the driver to create screenshots
	 * <p><code>
	 * | save screenshot after | <i>failure</i> |
	 * | save screenshot after | <i>error</i> |
	 * </code></p>
	 *
	 * <p><code>
	 * | save screenshot after | <i>every step</i> |
	 * | save screenshot after | <i>step</i> |
	 * </code></p>
